        "title": "Bookkeeping and Accounting | Sarfe Consulting",
        "order": 7,
        "meta_descr": "Sarfe Consulting offers comprehensive bookkeeping and accounting services to maintain accurate financial records and ensure compliance, allowing you to focus on growing your business.",
        "html_before": "<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Professional bookkeeping and accounting services by Sarfe Consulting. Maintain accurate records, streamline finances, and stay compliant with ease.\">\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"bookkeeping, accounting services, financial records, compliance, Sarfe Consulting, business accounting\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.sarfeconsulting.com/bookkeeping-accounting\">"
